      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom | 3 Bathroom | Approx. 136 sq. m. | Two Storeys | Two Designated Parking Spaces\r\n\r\nTurley Property Advisors are delighted to present this exceptional opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented three-bedroom terraced residence extending to approximately 136 sq. m., superbly positioned within the prestigious Druids Glen development in Newtownmountkennedy, Co. Wicklow.\r\n\r\nNo. 27 offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation over two floors, combining contemporary interiors with an impressive setting surrounded by mature woodland and landscaped grounds. The property presents beautifully throughout. On entering, a bright and welcoming hallway leads through to the principal living accommodation. The stylish kitchen is finished with sleek contemporary cabinetry, extensive worktop space and integrated appliances, with a separate utility area providing additional practicality.\r\n\r\nThe spacious living room is a particular highlight of the home. Warm timber flooring contrasts beautifully with the striking dark fitted cabinetry and feature fireplace wall, while large glazed doors introduce excellent natural light and provide a seamless connection with the outdoor space. To the rear, the property enjoys a private garden with a substantial covered timber terrace, creating an attractive extension of the living accommodation and a wonderful space for outdoor dining and entertaining. Mature hedging provides a pleasant green backdrop and a good degree of privacy.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including an impressive principal bedroom with extensive fitted storage/dressing space and en-suite facilities. The bathrooms are finished in a contemporary style, with attractive stone tiling and quality sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nA further feature is the upper-level balcony/terrace, which enjoys an attractive outlook across the surrounding mature grounds and countryside.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from two designated parking spaces.\r\nAccommodation & Key Features\r\n•\tApprox. 135 sq. m. of accommodation over two floors\r\n•\tThree bedrooms\r\n•\tThree bathrooms\r\n•\tContemporary fitted kitchen\r\n•\tSeparate utility area\r\n•\tImpressive principal bedroom accommodation\r\n•\tFitted dressing/ WFH office area\r\n•\tFeature fitted cabinetry and fireplace in living room\r\n•\tTimber flooring\r\n•\tPrivate rear garden\r\n•\tUpper-level balcony/terrace with attractive outlook\r\n•\tTwo designated parking spaces\r\n•\tMature and established surroundings\r\n•\tPrestigious Druids Glen Golf course on your doorstep\r\n•\tNew Boiler and Water Pump\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nThe setting is one of the strongest features of No. 27. Druids Glen is situated amid the rolling countryside of County Wicklow, between the Wicklow Mountains and the Irish Sea. The wider resort is home to the renowned Druids Glen and Druids Heath championship golf courses, together with hotel, dining, spa and leisure facilities. \r\n\r\nDespite its peaceful setting, the property is exceptionally well placed for access to Dublin and the surrounding towns. Druids Glen Resort describes its location as approximately 30 minutes from Dublin City Centre, 40 minutes from Dublin Airport, 15 minutes from Bray and Greystones and 20 minutes from Wicklow Town. \r\n\r\nNewtownmountkennedy also benefits from convenient access to the N11/M11 corridor, providing an important road connection north towards Dublin and south through County Wicklow. The location therefore offers an appealing balance: a tranquil, mature resort environment while remaining within convenient reach of Greystones, Bray, Wicklow and Dublin."
      },
